==English==

{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From French ''[[cocon]]'', diminutive of ''[[coque]]'' ‘shell’.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[silk]]y [[protective]] [[case]] spun by the [[larva|larvae]] of some [[insect]]s and [[moth]]s in which they [[metamorphose]], the [[pupa]].
# Any similar protective case, whether real or metaphorical.

